<title>GERMANY: RWE net profits up 4 mln dmk in Q1 96/97.</title>
<headline>RWE net profits up 4 mln dmk in Q1 96/97.</headline>
<dateline>ESSEN, Germany 1996-11-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>First quarter 1996/97</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit			   180     vs 176</p>
<p>    Group sales				  16,454  vs 15,234</p>
<p>    Investments				  1,054   vs 1,225</p>
<p>    No of employees			    136,678 vs 132,658</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German diversified utility group is RWE AG. In the business year 1996/97 RWE included acquisitions in the results. The group net profit figure does not include minority interests.</p>
</text>
